re not shown because of the instability of these estimates.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"* Weighted using NHIS sample adult weights.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}